abel(\"Fréquence\")\n","plt.title(\"Distribution des longueurs de phrases\")\n","\n","plt.legend()\n","\n","plt.show()"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":395},"id":"-LZA0vKHsZJz","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1778395734177,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":336,"user":{"displayName":"Soumana Dama","userId":"08207078104877937693"}},"outputId":"f0578858-3ffc-451c-ff5e-a1777f453597"},"execution_count":7,"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 1000x500 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["## Analyse du corpus\n","\n","L’analyse exploratoire montre que le corpus fourni contient principalement des séquences très courtes (souvent un seul mot ou token).\n","\n","On observe également la présence de tokens spéciaux tels que :\n","\n","- `[PAD]`\n","- `[UNK]`\n","- `[START]`\n","- `[END]`\n","\n","Cela suggère que le corpus est partiellement composé d’unités lexicales ou sous-lexicales issues d’un processus de tokenisation.\n","\n","Dans ce contexte low-resource, l’objectif du modèle est de produire une traduction robuste au niveau lexical et sur de courtes expressions, tout en maintenant une architecture simple, stable et interprétable."],"metadata":{"id":"AM_qIKz41QNx"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Partie 2\n","\n","# 2. Préparation des données\n","\n","Dans cette section, nous préparons les données pour l’entraînement du modèle de traduction.\n","\n","Les principales étapes sont :\n","\n","- nettoyage léger des séquences ;\n","- ajout de tokens spéciaux pour le décodage ;\n","- tokenisation ;\n","- conversion en séquences numériques ;\n","- padding des séquences ;\n","- découpage train/test.\n","\n","L’objectif est de transformer les données textuelles en tenseurs exploitables par le modèle Seq2Seq.\n","\n","ÉTAPE — Nettoyage léger"],"metadata":{"id":"x3rlDymT6aub"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# ==========================================\n","# Fonction de nettoyage\n","# ==========================================\n","\n","def preprocess_sentence(sentence):\n","\n","    sentence = sentence.lower().strip()\n","\n","    return sentence"],"metadata":{"id":"XthT2ftg60wg","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1778395734188,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":6,"user":{"displayName":"Soumana Dama","userId":"08207078104877937693"}}},"execution_count":8,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Préprocessing du corpus"],"metadata":{"id":"fvCW1x3y64Sy"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# ==========================================\n","# Application du preprocessing\n","# ==========================================\n","\n","moore_sentences = [\n","    preprocess_sentence(sentence)\n","    for sentence in moore_sentences\n","]\n","\n","french_sentences = [\n","    preprocess_sentence(sentence)\n","    for sentence in french_sentences\n","]"],"metadata":{"id":"dWPKm6Cj69wV","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1778395734204,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":7,"user":{"displayName":"Soumana Dama","userId":"08207078104877937693"}}},"execution_count":9,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Ajouter <start> et <end>"],"metadata":{"id":"Sp4-VGtR7E20"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# ==========================================\n","# Ajout des tokens spéciaux\n","# ==========================================\n","\n","french_sentences = [\n","    \"<start> \" + sentence + \" <end>\"\n","    for sentence in french_sentences\n","]\n","for i in range(5):\n","    print(\"Moore :\", moore_sentences[i])\n","    print(\"Français :\", french_sentences[i])\n","    print(\"-\" * 40)"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"O9iwSTQ17U7Z","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1778395734235,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":26,"user":{"displayName":"Soumana Dama","userId":"08207078104877937693"}},"outputId":"5d81139c-33f2-4bfc-e379-466f941c12a9"},"execution_count":10,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Moore : [pad]\n","Français : <start> [pad] <end>\n","----------------------------------------\n","Moore : [unk]\n","Français : <start> [unk] <end>\n","----------------------------------------\n","Moore : [start]\n","Français : <start> [start] <end>\n","----------------------------------------\n","Moore : [end]\n","Français : <start> [end] <end>\n","----------------------------------------\n","Moore : !\n","Français : <start> ! <end>\n","----------------------------------------\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["ÉTAPE — Tokenization avec le NLP\n","## Tokenisation\n","\n","La tokenisation consiste à transformer les séquences textuelles en identifiants numériques exploitables par le modèle.\n","\n","Chaque mot/token reçoit un indice unique à partir du vocabulaire observé dans le corpus.\n","\n","Deux tokenizers distincts sont utilisés :\n","- un pour le Moore ;\n","- un pour le Français."],"metadata":{"id":"yioGLIccQEWm"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# ==========================================\n","# Tokenizers\n","# ==========================================\n","\n","moore_tokenizer = Tokenizer(filters='')\n","\n","french_tokenizer = Tokenizer(filters='')\n","\n","moore_tokenizer.fit_on_texts(moore_sentences)\n","\n","french_tokenizer.fit_on_texts(french_sentences)\n","\n","filters=''"],"metadata":{"id":"m70Kt56FQSVy","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1778395734383,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":144,"user":{"displayName":"Soumana Dama","userId":"08207078104877937693"}}},"execution_count":11,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Conversion en séquences"],"metadata":{"id":"33JrNHBXQZfk"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# ==========================================\n","# Conversion texte -> séquences\n","# ==========================================\n","\n","encoder_sequences = moore_tokenizer.texts_to_sequences(\n","    moore_sentences\n",")\n","\n","decoder_sequences = french_tokenizer.texts_to_sequences(\n","    french_sentences\n",")"],"metadata":{"id":"elkbfQahQced","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1778395734388,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":50,"user":{"displayName":"Soumana Dama","userId":"08207078104877937693"}}},"execution_count":12,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Taille vocabulaire"],"metadata":{"id":"2rmFIuYSQh_x"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# ==========================================\n","# Taille des vocabulaires\n","# ==========================================\n","\n","encoder_vocab_size = len(moore_tokenizer.word_index) + 1\n","\n","decoder_vocab_size = len(french_tokenizer.word_index) + 1\n","\n","print(\"Taille vocabulaire Moore :\", encoder_vocab_size)\n","\n","print(\"Taille vocabulaire Français :\", decoder_vocab_size)\n","\n","# ==========================================\n","# Longueur maximale des séquences\n","# ==========================================\n","\n","max_encoder_len = max(\n","    len(seq) for seq in encoder_sequences\n",")\n","\n","max_decoder_len = max(\n","    len(seq) for seq in decoder_sequences\n",")\n","\n","print(\"Longueur max Moore :\", max_encoder_len)\n","\n","print(\"Longueur max Français :\", max_decoder_len)\n","\n","# ==========================================\n","# Padding des séquences\n","# ==========================================\n","\n","encoder_input_data = pad_sequences(\n","    encoder_sequences,\n","    maxlen=max_encoder_len,\n","    padding='post'\n",")\n","\n","decoder_input_data = pad_sequences(\n","    decoder_sequences,\n","    maxlen=max_decoder_len,\n","    padding='post'\n",")"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"APMaC-qLQlAi","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1778395734431,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":41,"user":{"displayName":"Soumana Dama","userId":"08207078104877937693"}},"outputId":"cda2f32b-3944-4b0e-f68a-34a9568409a7"},"execution_count":13,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Taille vocabulaire Moore : 5330\n","Taille vocabulaire Français : 5060\n","Longueur max Moore : 1\n","Longueur max Français : 3\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["IMPORTANT — Préparation cible decoder\n","\n","Le Seq2Seq a besoin :\n","\n","entrée decoder ;\n","sortie decoder décalée."],"metadata":{"id":"VMPM5eulQ1BB"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# ==========================================\n","# Decoder target data\n","# ==========================================\n","\n","decoder_target_data = np.zeros_like(decoder_input_data)\n","\n","decoder_target_data[:, :-1] = decoder_input_data[:, 1:]"],"metadata":{"id":"zu8jFEXKQ4CQ","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1778395734433,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":8,"user":{"displayName":"Soumana Dama","userId":"08207078104877937693"}}},"execution_count":14,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Train/Test split"],"metadata":{"id":"zcvJ_LwZQ9Jv"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# ==========================================\n","# Train / Test split\n","# ==========================================\n","\n","(\n","    encoder_train,\n","    encoder_test,\n","    decoder_train,\n","    decoder_test,\n","    target_train,\n","    target_test\n",") = train_test_split(\n","    encoder_input_data,\n","    decoder_input_data,\n","    decoder_target_data,\n","    test_size=0.2,\n","    random_state=42\n",")\n","\n","print(\"Train size :\", len(encoder_train))\n","print(\"Test size :\", len(encoder_test))"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"JS-tTaMCRAbH","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1778395734448,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":12,"user":{"displayName":"Soumana Dama","userId":"08207078104877937693"}},"outputId":"8669dcbe-f900-4183-b5a9-cba2bb677a42"},"execution_count":15,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Train size : 4264\n","Test size : 1066\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["**ÉTAPE SUIVANTE — Construction du modèle**\n","\n","Maintenant on entre dans la partie centrale du projet.\n","\n","# 3. Construction du modèle\n","\n","Le modèle utilisé est une architecture Seq2Seq basée sur des couches LSTM.\n","\n","Le système est composé de deux parties :\n","\n","- un encodeur qui transforme la séquence Moore en représentation vectorielle ;\n","- un décodeur qui génère progressivement la traduction française.\n","\n","Des couches Embedding sont utilisées afin de projeter les tokens dans un espace vectoriel dense avant l’apprentissage séquentiel."],"metadata":{"id":"zeZgf0KPSln5"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["**Hyperparamètres**"],"metadata":{"id":"ccrnqiJ2SyEL"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# ==========================================\n","# Hyperparamètres\n","# ==========================================\n","\n","EMBEDDING_DIM = 64\n","\n","LSTM_UNITS = 128\n","\n","BATCH_SIZE = 32\n","\n","EPOCHS = 15"],"metadata":{"id":"3jlpziJrS15a","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1778395734484,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":30,"user":{"displayName":"Soumana Dama","userId":"08207078104877937693"}}},"execution_count":16,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["**Construction** **Encoder**"],"metadata":{"id":"6tkdtAp9S4vo"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# ==========================================\n","# Encodeur\n","# ==========================================\n","\n","encoder_inputs = Input(shape=(max_encoder_len,))\n","\n","encoder_embedding = Embedding(\n","    input_dim=encoder_vocab_size,\n","    output_dim=EMBEDDING_DIM\n",")(encoder_inputs)\n","\n","encoder_lstm = LSTM(\n","    LSTM_UNITS,\n","    return_state=True\n",")\n","\n","_, state_h, state_c = encoder_lstm(\n","    encoder_embedding\n",")\n","\n","encoder_states = [state_h, state_c]"],"metadata":{"id":"iRd6-KQVTF1W","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1778395736379,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":1889,"user":{"displayName":"Soumana Dama","userId":"08207078104877937693"}}},"execution_count":17,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["**Construction Decoder**"],"metadata":{"id":"2988vrbGTJCx"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# ==========================================\n","# Décodeur\n","# ==========================================\n","\n","decoder_inputs = Input(shape=(max_decoder_len,))\n","\n","decoder_embedding = Embedding(\n","    input_dim=decoder_vocab_size,\n","    output_dim=EMBEDDING_DIM\n",")(decoder_inputs)\n","\n","decoder_lstm = LSTM(\n","    LSTM_UNITS,\n","    return_sequences=True,\n","    return_state=True\n",")\n","\n","decoder_outputs, _, _ = decoder_lstm(\n","    decoder_embedding,\n","    initial_state=encoder_states\n",")\n","\n","decoder_dense = Dense(\n","    decoder_vocab_size,\n","    activation='softmax'\n",")\n","\n","decoder_outputs = decoder_dense(\n","    decoder_outputs\n",")"],"metadata":{"id":"IcS5AdyuTMt3","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1778395736381,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":6,"user":{"displayName":"Soumana Dama","userId":"08207078104877937693"}}},"execution_count":18,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["**Création modèle**"],"metadata":{"id":"_yRU5p2GTQel"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# ==========================================\n","# Modèle Seq2Seq\n","# ==========================================\n","\n","model = Model(\n","    [encoder_inputs, decoder_inputs],\n","    decoder_outputs\n",")\n","\n","model.compile(\n","    optimizer='adam',\n","    loss='sparse_categorical_crossentropy',\n","    metrics=['accuracy']\n",")\n","\n","model.summary()"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":510},"id":"-M7AEObtTZN-","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1778395736452,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":70,"user":{"displayName":"Soumana Dama","userId":"08207078104877937693"}},"outputId":"f64fbe96-5704-42e9-fcdc-18b8efeeb174"},"execution_count":19,"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["\u001b[1mModel: \"functional\"\u001b[0m\n"],"text/html":["<pre style=\"white-space:pre;overflow-x:auto;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono',consol